WEBVTT

00:00:00.537 --> 00:00:02.749
₹315.

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:06.859
That's a day's wage, for millions of women in India.

00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:11.705
She takes the bus to the office.

00:00:12.081 --> 00:00:13.453
Waits her turn.

00:00:13.673 --> 00:00:14.839
Wrong counter.

00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:17.110
And the day is gone.

00:00:20.869 --> 00:00:23.138
What if she could ask first?

00:00:23.229 --> 00:00:26.359
A short chat, in Hindi or English.

00:00:26.437 --> 00:00:28.467
Only the questions that matter.

00:00:28.687 --> 00:00:31.972
And "I don't know" is always an answer.

00:00:33.443 --> 00:00:35.706
Three answers, not two.

00:00:36.438 --> 00:00:37.254
Yes.

00:00:37.693 --> 00:00:38.373
No.

00:00:38.887 --> 00:00:40.358
And unknown.

00:00:40.603 --> 00:00:42.930
It tells her what to find out.

00:00:43.023 --> 00:00:46.945
Every rule is checked, and signed, by a person.

00:00:47.071 --> 00:00:49.796
No machine decides who qualifies.

00:00:53.522 --> 00:00:56.696
Now she knows where to go, and what to carry.

00:00:57.435 --> 00:00:58.649
Right counter.

00:01:00.694 --> 00:01:02.208
Right papers.

00:01:04.044 --> 00:01:05.446
Yojana Sathi.

00:01:05.466 --> 00:01:07.118
Know before you go.

00:01:07.468 --> 00:01:10.133
Free, in Hindi and English.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.900
sathi.avinashnegi.com
